# ============================================================
# Stone Art Blog Manager 配置示例
# 复制为 config.local.env 后填写真实值：
# cp config.example.env config.local.env
# chmod 600 config.local.env
# ============================================================

# ---------- 网站后台 ----------
STONEART_BASE_URL=https://www.stoneartsculpture.com
STONEART_ADMIN_USER=admin
STONEART_ADMIN_PASSWORD=change-me

# ---------- 阿里云百炼 Wan2.7 图片编辑 ----------
ALIYUN_WAN_COMPATIBLE_BASE_URL=https://llm-v3z08l00fgpgh0fo.cn-beijing.maas.aliyuncs.com/compatible-mode/v1
ALIYUN_WAN_DASHSCOPE_BASE_URL=https://llm-v3z08l00fgpgh0fo.cn-beijing.maas.aliyuncs.com/api/v1
ALIYUN_DASHSCOPE_API_KEY=change-me
WAN_IMAGE_MODEL=wan2.7-image

# ---------- DeepSeek 文本与图片理解 ----------
DEEPSEEK_BASE_URL=https://api.deepseek.com/v1
DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=change-me
DEEPSEEK_MODEL=deepseek-flash

# ---------- 新建博客默认作者信息 ----------
DEFAULT_AUTHOR_NAME=Tian Xiang
DEFAULT_AUTHOR_ROLE=General Manager
DEFAULT_AUTHOR_AVATAR=/uploads/49501e988c3c5c53-jpeg
DEFAULT_AUTHOR_BIO=Tian Xiang is the General Manager of Stone Art Sculpture. He leads custom sculpture projects from concept and design coordination through production and delivery, working closely with international clients on marble, bronze, and stainless steel commissions.
